<title>USA: Family Golf acquires five centers.</title>
<headline>Family Golf acquires five centers.</headline>
<dateline>MELVILLE, N.Y. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Family Golf Centers Inc said Friday that it acquired five additional centers in five states, increasing its facilities to 30 in 13 states.</p>
<p>The acquisitions include centers in Colorado, Maryland and Massachusetts, marking initial entry into these states, the company said.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
